OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fdry this evening and overnight with
OL,7,Fvariable amounts of cloud and the odd
OL,8,Fshower possible. Thicker cloud arrives
OL,9,Facross the north of the region towards
OL,10,Fdawn with outbreaks of light and
OL,11,Fpatchy rain.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain, this becoming locally heavy and
OL,15,Fpersistent across the north of the
OL,16,Fregion. Turning drier and brighter
OL,17,Ffrom the west during the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
