OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter on Thursday before
OL,7,Fanother band of rain moves into the
OL,8,Fnorthwest into Friday. This clearing
OL,9,Fsouthwards on Saturday. Average
OL,10,Ftemperatures by day but chilly at
OL,11,Fnight.
